   I think the cdhdtape image was used before the iso images were generally 
available, and I suspect that they haven't been tested in quite a while 
and the install documentation likely needs some updating depending upon 
whether the cdhdtape image is no longer valid or if it just needs some 
fixing.

> By the way, can you say which block size value should be used when copying 
> cdhdtape to a hard disk with dd?  This file:
>
>  ftp://ftp.netbsd.org/pub/NetBSD/NetBSD-5.0/alpha/INSTALL.txt
